tural language documents. Here a similar attempt at solving the problem has been performed, where part of a article from Wikipedia has been used as corpus and was tested against different type of questions that the program can answer correctly. Advanced QA requires sophisticated text processing tools based on state-of-the-art NLP.","topics":[],"score":229194,"global_rank":109293},{"name":"adityagollapalli/InventoryManagementSystem","owner":"adityagollapalli","html_url":"https://github.com/adityagollapalli/InventoryManagementSystem","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229175,"global_rank":109313},{"name":"sandeepkv93/distributed-kth-frequent","owner":"sandeepkv93","html_url":"https://github.com/sandeepkv93/distributed-kth-frequent","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"A high-performance, distributed system for finding the kth most frequent element in a dataset, built with Java 21 and designed for scalability and reliability.","topics":[],"score":229175,"global_rank":109314},{"name":"hugoyervides/pokedex","owner":"hugoyervides","html_url":"https://github.com/hugoyervides/pokedex","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229166,"global_rank":109389},{"name":"ayyagarisujanreddy123/PAN-patent-Assistant-Network-","owner":"ayyagarisujanreddy123","html_url":"https://github.com/ayyagarisujanreddy123/PAN-patent-Assistant-Network-","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"JDBC Java Connection For Database  Patient Assistance Network","topics":[],"score":229121,"global_rank":109493},{"name":"Telmen17/ChatApp-CS460","owner":"Telmen17","html_url":"https://github.com/Telmen17/ChatApp-CS460","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229121,"global_rank":109494}]